{"surah":102,"ayahs":[{"n":1,"arabic":"أَلۡهَىٰكُمُ ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","translit":"Alhakumu alttakathuru","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you"}},{"n":2,"arabic":"حَتَّىٰ زُرۡتُمُ ٱلۡمَقَابِرَ","translit":"Hatta zurtumu almaqabira","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Until you visit the graveyards"}},{"n":3,"arabic":"كَلَّا سَوۡفَ تَعۡلَمُونَ","translit":"Kalla sawfa taAAlamoona","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"No! You are going to know"}},{"n":4,"arabic":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوۡفَ تَعۡلَمُونَ","translit":"Thumma kalla sawfa taAAlamoona","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Then no! You are going to know"}},{"n":5,"arabic":"كَلَّا لَوۡ تَعۡلَمُونَ عِلۡمَ ٱلۡيَقِينِ","translit":"Kalla law taAAlamoona AAilma alyaqeeni","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty"}},{"n":6,"arabic":"لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلۡجَحِيمَ","translit":"Latarawunna aljaheema","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"You will surely see the Hellfire"}},{"n":7,"arabic":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيۡنَ ٱلۡيَقِينِ","translit":"Thumma latarawunnaha AAayna alyaqeeni","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty"}},{"n":8,"arabic":"ثُمَّ لَتُسۡـَٔلُنَّ يَوۡمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","translit":"Thumma latusalunna yawmaithin AAani alnnaAAeemi","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure"}}]}